    "I need to raise a concern about the flow chart. Every box leads somewhere. Every diamond offers yes or no. There is no box that says \"you will stand in the hallway for eleven minutes and then do nothing,\" which is the actual outcome of most processes at this company.\n\nWhoever draws these things believes decisions have two branches. I have never in my life encountered a decision with two branches. I have encountered a fog and a deadline.\n\nI've drafted an amended version with a single unlabeled arrow that loops back into itself. I think it's more accurate. I'm not going to present it, because there's no box for that.": "2026-10-21",
